{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"4d67a7cc9c128eb398853028ad2826b51899c6b8cf2d704ee823f3e72cdbca2b","ja":"…………。\nあっ、みなさん、お疲れ様です……。","zh":"…………。\n啊，各位辛苦了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"172fe0dfc0738fbe3c104f695718e05b2d6ce6f31f56674d662da92a5313aab2","ja":"お疲れ様で～す。\nあれっ？　紬さん、なんだか元気がないですね？","zh":"辛苦啦～\n咦？紬小姐，怎么感觉有点没精神呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8073bd2345742774c4cf4f5b99496883a960a6cb4299be98350b659be421fbd0","ja":"はい。実は、\nトーク番組の、出演依頼をいただきまして……。","zh":"是的。其实，\n我收到了脱口秀节目的出演邀请……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"0a57e030eb9cf5e0fadc3342e2df357ef8bec795413d0b7aa48826fc9d63337b","ja":"劇場のアイドルにオファーが来たので、\n●●●●プロデューサーが私を推薦したと。","zh":"剧场偶像接到了通告邀请，\n所以●●●●制作人推荐了我，是这样吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"da28b67b1f57554394608275cdc614689ca794b7b6957d34ab619e962baa2512","ja":"え～っ、いいな～！\nわたしも出た～い！","zh":"诶～真好啊～！\n我也想出场～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"b8c15ba93d9c504e888940f8ee76eeae16d9d83fb2617a325c7effe7badac1e8","ja":"ただ、番組では『私の変わったエピソード』について、\nお話しすることになっているそうで……。","zh":"不过，据说在节目中要聊的是\n关于“我自己与众不同的经历”……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2d60d90b2fc27463e060eb3b77edaafc0cc3462e9dca83331b8882e9bcd3283a","ja":"ですが、私は特段、面白い人間ではありませんし。\nいいエピソードが思いつかず、どうしたものかと。","zh":"可是，我也算不上什么特别有趣的人。\n一时想不到什么好的轶事，不知该如何是好。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"fd9eca4268426701318005c78e57e46185a052cbe97c20d1eebf4017e670f3f6","ja":"紬さんの変わったエピソード……。\nうーん……どんなのがいいんだろか？","zh":"紬非同寻常的事迹……\n嗯……选什么样的才好呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"e3200340459e894eb4520b0ebaa456fd9c5ad75735473850f07638a15aa218e7","ja":"そのトークの内容って、\n今すぐ決めなきゃダメなの？","zh":"脱口秀的内容，\n必须现在就决定吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"af76d50c5aaa96724bd0373732cfdcb154ada4414fd8b7ba5e48ff4e0dc0d47d","ja":"いえ、まだ少し時間があります。","zh":"不，还有一点时间。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"b9fee8a4eddf233727722b73ec78e3c97f7b740d1f87eaff05e60520d7f80cd1","ja":"じゃあとりあえず、\n受けるだけ受けちゃえば、いいんじゃないですか？","zh":"那要不然先接下来试试看，\n不也挺好吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"4b84467ed704ffd35b657d7df75b213d6791739abf51d0697ab97c7346881f92","ja":"エピソードは、期限までに用意できればOKですよ！","zh":"剧集只要在期限前准备好就没问题哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"ed1561f90c9f31532fd02cbf2ca61dd0a7b9af65e8cebb91b4cee5e531d9351f","ja":"そうだね。●●●●プロデューサーも、\n紬なら大丈夫って、推薦してくれたんだろうし。","zh":"是啊。毕竟●●●●制作人也是因为觉得\n只要是紬就没问题，才推荐了她的吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[38].text","source_sha256":"fa5db857b1ed4597f7a4799268073c3150789fb42b7aefadc521e1feae1802ec","ja":"どうしても思いつかないようなら、\n一緒に考えるよ！","zh":"要是实在想不到的话，\n我来和你一起想吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[39].text","source_sha256":"a0f06f4c9deffd724ad7292cb381bec5ceaa59df54cda7c47b8321d96c8270b3","ja":"みんなで考えれば、きっと何か思いつくよぉ。","zh":"大家一起想的话，一定能想到什么好主意的嘛～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"8605f3d04581bf7036f4dee46fab0113323b220041dc71586cd7e7b4eb3bef97","ja":"みなさん、ありがとうございます！","zh":"谢谢大家！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1475.unity3d","item_key":"commands[48].text","source_sha256":"f334803db12d7c19fdd30ca680935ba70027532c10951c145d24830f9ba4999c","ja":"そうですね、まだ時間はありますし。\n思い切って、お引き受けしてみます！","zh":"是啊，反正还有时间。\n我就放手一搏，试着接下这份工作吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
